assets/documents/cv/CV_Jonas_Heinle_english.pdf | 3736 | the documents page links it; WebDAV has no cv/ folder, so this is its only home
assets/documents/cv/CV_Jonas_Heinle_german.pdf | 3736 | the documents page links it; WebDAV has no cv/ folder, so this is its only home
web/sqlite3.wasm | 740 | the sqlite3 WASM build the web app loads; setup-sqlite3-wasm.sh fetches and checks it, this copy serves flutter run -d chrome
